# Nightdesk keys
#
# Copy this file to .env in the repository root, then fill in the keys you have:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Leave the rest blank or delete the lines. A blank line means "not set".
# Run `nightdesk doctor` at any time to see which sources are ready.
# .env is git-ignored: never commit it.
#
# The Belgian Infrabel punctuality file is public and needs no key, so you can
# start with an empty .env.

# Every key below is free. Get your own: a key belongs to an account, so
# someone else's file will not work on your machine.

# --- Netherlands: NS engineering works -------------------------------------
# Free key from the NS API portaal.
#   https://apiportal.ns.nl/signin  -> subscribe to the NS App product
# Feeds `nightdesk fetch-ns`. The primary key is the one to use.
NS_API_KEY=

# --- Germany: DB station boards --------------------------------------------
# Free key pair from the DB API Marketplace. Register, open the OpenBoards
# product, subscribe to the Free plan, then read the client id and API key
# from your applications:
#   https://developers.deutschebahn.com/db-api-marketplace/apis/product/open-boards
# Both values are needed. The older Timetables product is being retired and no
# longer accepts new subscriptions.
# Feeds `nightdesk fetch-db-boards`.
DB_CLIENT_ID=
DB_API_KEY=

# --- Switzerland: SIRI planned disruptions ---------------------------------
# Free token from the Swiss API manager: register, request the SIRI interface,
# then generate a token for it.
#   https://api-manager.opentransportdata.swiss/
# Feeds `nightdesk fetch-swiss-siri`.
SWISS_OTD_TOKEN=

# --- Train Archive: daily trips by train number ----------------------------
# Free account, signed in with a code sent to your email (no password), then
# copy a token. Open access covers the last 7 days and up to 5 sources per
# 30 days.
#   https://www.train-archive.eu/account?new=1
#   https://www.train-archive.eu/account/tokens
# Feeds `nightdesk fetch-train-archive`.
TRAIN_ARCHIVE_TOKEN=

# --- Mistral: optional drafting of work fields from a notice ---------------
# Only used by `nightdesk text` and only when a case folder has recorded consent.
# Everything else works without it.
#   https://console.mistral.ai/
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
